Pausing now would cut spend on a channel whose efficiency is moving in the right direction.

One more caveat: my platform view aggregates all Reddit campaigns — I don't have campaign-level breakdowns, so "the worst Reddit campaign" isn't identifiable from what I can pull. If you have a specific campaign in mind, name it and I'll check whether a proposal is warranted.

